{"version":1,"key":"card:235","content":{"id":235,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 调用，也可以不通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 调用。JavaScript 的函数含有两个内部可见的方法，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Call]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Construct]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当一个函数通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 调用时，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Construct]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法就会被调用，该方法是用来创建一个新对象的，称之为实例，通过函数体内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"this","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来设置实例。拥有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Construct]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法的函数叫做构造器，并不是所有的函数都有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Construct]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，例如箭头函数就没有。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当函数不是通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 调用时，就是调用函数内部的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Call]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，它会执行函数的方法体。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么如何分辨函数以何种方式调用呢？一般我们都是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"instanceof","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来判断"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function Person(name) {\n  if (this instanceof Person) {\n    this.name = name;\n  } else {\n    throw new Error(\"You must use new with Person\");\n  }\n}\n\nlet person = new Person(\"Alice\");\nlet notAPerson = Person(\"Bob\"); // Error: You must use new with Person","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ec58f103-14e5-43ff-a2c3-3513bc4cde96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的方法能够有效是因为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Construct]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法会创建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Person","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实例，并将它赋值给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"this","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。但是这个方法并不可靠，因为不使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 也可以得到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Person","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实例"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function Person(name) {\n  if (this instanceof Person) {\n    this.name = name;\n  } else {\n    throw new Error(\"You must use new with Person\");\n  }\n}\n\nlet person = new Person(\"Alice\");\nlet notAPerson = Person.call(person, \"Bob\"); // 没有报错","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"67c728ca-4fea-4cf0-a836-1487ffe7330b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES6 中可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new.target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来判断该函数的调用方式，如果一个函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Construct]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法被调用，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"new.target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值就会被赋值为新创建的对象，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[Call]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 被调用，那么 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new.target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"undefiend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。所以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new.target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以方便的知道是通过何种方式调用的函数"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function Person(name) {\n  if (new.target !== undefined) {\n    this.name = name;\n  } else {\n    throw new Error(\"You must use new with Person\");\n  }\n}\n\nlet person = new Person(\"Alice\");\nlet notAPerson = Person.call(person, \"Bob\"); // Error: You must use new with Person","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2b16f8af-03f8-4702-a371-33ec1e984136","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"danger","title":"DANGER","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在函数的外部不能使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"new.target","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"， 否则会报语法错误。"}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690902297154,"updateTime":1743303640411,"linkedCards":[{"id":240,"target":{"key":"card:240","type":"card","id":240},"summary":"箭头函数与一般函数的不同： 函数内部没有 this ， arguments ， new.target 绑定 不能通过 new 的方式被调用，上文提及过，箭头函数内部没有 [[Construct]] 方法 没有 prototype 尽管箭头函...","tags":["JavaScript/箭头函数"]},{"id":284,"target":{"key":"card:284","type":"card","id":284},"summary":"可以在类的 contructor 方法中访问 new.target ，通过 new.target 可以构造一个抽象类，所谓的抽象类，指的就是不能被 new 出实例的类，它只能被继承 class Shape { constructor(nam...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640411}}